id=pixel-tv-box
name=Pixel to TV Box Transformer
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=100
author=preetstyle
description=Transforms any Google Pixel (or Android phone with DisplayPort Alt Mode) into a dedicated Apple tvOS style Android TV Box. Kills broken touchscreen driver, locks 16:9 1080p landscape, auto-enables HDMI mirroring on any TV, enables wireless ADB, and optimizes battery/thermals for 24/7 docking.
